      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: We just tried it out. World (SDK2) with toggleable seats. If a 3.0 Avatar sits down it has a chance to crash the one sitting down or even others as well. When my friend tried to sit down she got stuck in T-Pose and roughly 15 seconds three people crashed. Two others didnt crash. Said avatar is using the \"old\" sdk where write defaults is still on and is using default locomotion and sitting layer. Uploaded her a day before the update with \"please write defaults off\" happened. It was working fine back then.",
      "viewerReactions": null
